—Fiction. | School—Fiction.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#38"}, {"id": "en-copyright-39", "kind": "text", "text": "Classification: LCC PZ7.1.W396 My 2016 | DDC [Fic]—dc23", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#39"}, {"id": "en-copyright-40", "kind": "text", "text": "LC record available at http://lccn.loc.gov/2016005816", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#40"}, {"id": "en-copyright-41", "kind": "text", "text": "ISBNs: 978-1-9753-2501-5 (paperback)", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#41"}, {"id": "en-copyright-42", "kind": "text", "text": "978-1-9753-3366-9 (ebook)", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#42"}, {"id": "en-copyright-43", "kind": "text", "text": "E3-20220526-JV-NF-ORI", "source": "OEBPS/Text/copyright.xhtml#43"}, {"id": "en-toc-0", "kind": "heading", "text": "Contents", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#0", "headingLevel": 2}, {"id": "en-toc-1", "kind": "text", "text": "Cover", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#1"}, {"id": "en-toc-2", "kind": "text", "text": "Insert", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#2"}, {"id": "en-toc-3", "kind": "text", "text": "Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#3"}, {"id": "en-toc-4", "kind": "text", "text": "Copyright", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#4"}, {"id": "en-toc-5", "kind": "text", "text": "Cast of Characters", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#5"}, {"id": "en-toc-6", "kind": "text", "text": "Prelude 1", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#6", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-7", "kind": "text", "text": "1: Nevertheless, Hachiman Hikigaya’s life goes on.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#7", "emphasis": [{"start": 17, "end": 34, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-8", "kind": "text", "text": "Prelude 2", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#8", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-9", "kind": "text", "text": "2: Eventually, he’ll become used to this relationship, too.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#9", "emphasis": [{"start": 21, "end": 53, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-10", "kind": "text", "text": "Prelude 3", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#10", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-11", "kind": "text", "text": "3: Surely, he will remember that season every time he smells that scent.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#11", "emphasis": [{"start": 19, "end": 39, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-12", "kind": "text", "text": "Prelude 4", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#12", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-13", "kind": "text", "text": "4: And then Yukino Yukinoshita quietly waves.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#13", "emphasis": [{"start": 12, "end": 30, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-14", "kind": "text", "text": "Interlude", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#14", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-15", "kind": "text", "text": "5: Gallantly, Shizuka Hiratsuka walks ahead.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#15", "emphasis": [{"start": 14, "end": 31, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-16", "kind": "text", "text": "6: Just like that time before, Yui Yuigahama implores.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#16", "emphasis": [{"start": 31, "end": 44, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-17", "kind": "text", "text": "Interlude", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#17", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-18", "kind": "text", "text": "Interlude", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#18", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-19", "kind": "text", "text": "7: The heat touching him is the only feeling that does clearly get across.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#19", "emphasis": [{"start": 7, "end": 24, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-20", "kind": "text", "text": "8: That door is opened once more.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#20", "emphasis": [{"start": 3, "end": 12, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-21", "kind": "text", "text": "Interlude", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#21", "emphasis": [{"start": 0, "end": 9, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-22", "kind": "text", "text": "9: Even if it’s faded by the passing months, that green remains green.", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#22", "emphasis": [{"start": 56, "end": 69, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-23", "kind": "text", "text": "10: That’s why Hachiman Hikigaya said…", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#23", "emphasis": [{"start": 15, "end": 32, "style": "strong"}]}, {"id": "en-toc-24", "kind": "text", "text": "Afterword", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#24"}, {"id": "en-toc-25", "kind": "text", "text": "Translation Notes", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#25"}, {"id": "en-toc-26", "kind": "text", "text": "Yen Newsletter", "source": "OEBPS/Text/toc.xhtml#26"}, {"id": "en-preface001-0", "kind": "image", "text": "Book Title Page", "source": "OEBPS/Text/preface001.xhtml#../Images/Art_P1.jpg", "src": "assets/english/volume-14/Art_P1.webp", "width": 1200, "height": 1800}]}
